{"id":"21a834c868e3b41d","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-delta02-hyperimmune.md","title":"非零Δ⁰₂度超免疫","display":"thm-delta02-hyperimmune — 非零Δ⁰₂度超免疫","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-delta02-hyperimmune","aliases":["43-thm-delta02-hyperimmune"],"display":"thm-delta02-hyperimmune — 非零Δ⁰₂度超免疫","depends_on":["[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-jump]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Proposition 5.14.2, print pp.57–58 / PDF pp.77–78","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-delta02-hyperimmune"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-delta02-hyperimmune</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-delta02-hyperimmune — 非零Δ⁰₂度超免疫"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"df08310d02ee0072\" href=\"?note=df08310d02ee0072\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-free\">43-df-hyperimmune-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Proposition 5.14.2, print pp.57–58 / PDF pp.77–78"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"df08310d02ee0072\" href=\"?note=df08310d02ee0072\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-free\">43-df-hyperimmune-free</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T\\varnothing\\prime\\land A\\not\\le_T\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_T\\varnothing\\prime\\land A\\not\\le_T\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从可计算逼近取首次正确n位的阶段函数，它可从A计算。若被可计算函数逐点控制，便可通过在有限阶段中搜索已出现的更长前缀恢复A，矛盾。</p>\n<p>来源：Proposition 5.14.2, print pp.57–58 / PDF pp.77–78。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"df08310d02ee0072","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"